      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11.12月如果還有安排G3賽事<br />\n一樣會在海電電FB粉絲團公告<br />\n請大家持續鎖定唷👍<br />\n<br />\n#戰鬥陀螺 #官方賽 #台南 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861525438_1562568199224784_4573749370854393874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=Vmsv6WzQtMkQ7kNvwEUeVeN&amp;_nc_oc=AdrSUgEER5G0yd7FQILOo3wfZqbJ-7nNzGvmH_U6X3JUfqiz8oT2ReyuaY_XTzpI1VQ&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-vie1-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=zRhhbKvGBXQaVJ7nPzdTTw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLWAxEsxekzuZptEfvf_wHqFeVgqa7zYu61JLVS-jX7v-qY8a4ta4CORxJcTCJUIM9lz1FFG9iE&amp;oh=00_AQPAPBtC6XdpsYXUJisE76ats4qHHMICZfPeIUlO45sU-A&amp;oe=6AE28C64\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/862850795_1562568812558056_5073562579851793284_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=3MSzdx5ajWEQ7kNvwEooOQR&amp;_nc_oc=AdpNfMeD0OsPd4TgBcegkdCS1mZejS7y7Qjb08HLh9CBD8aZfE3jRgC-kmjiP1FUfis&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-vie1-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=zRhhbKvGBXQaVJ7nPzdTTw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQK5cLUanLJYqBKJWqUCUXbrOHQ2rKvfmA5eRuOdhmmAVbyIV5IwRG99el4uIl31zVC_oM7sr5lm&amp;oh=00_AQMvjwCQpUF2XDrpGT5kBNQxZmrhSfq9UmLcxQo843o9Qw&amp;oe=6AE27CC5\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861217877_1562568825891388_430941940602498468_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=rbdohIpn8YEQ7kNvwFkQds0&amp;_nc_oc=Adpz5eHax6cGV5xS19wCdoZO1mafoHvXyJzqnJ93KMBoUPST4qvqOVgIJkfONTLyuC4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-vie1-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=zRhhbKvGBXQaVJ7nPzdTTw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKg_eUdlM9e_mQXQKDmqYRepvw-oJUMH5s-gpan9MnAOV