      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n#TOMS品牌商品來報報<br />\n⭐TOM'S 手指彈力遊戲機<br />\n-<br />\n藍色、黑色共兩色💙🖤<br />\n可愛小型手指版拳擊台！<br />\n可切換無/有音樂模式🔕<br />\n不想太吵雜也可以安靜遊玩！<br />\n適合與親子同樂朋友聚會PK遊玩🤼🤼🤼<br />\n看看誰材質最厲害的拳(手)擊(指)手！<br />\n-<br />\n▪ 材質：塑膠 (ＰＰ)、電子零件<br />\n▪ 尺寸：10.6×14.9×18.9 cm±5%<br />\n小編分數最多５００左右💥同事打到９９９!!!<br />\n✨預計１０月中可至各現場尋寶看看哦！✨<br />\n-<br />\n✨彩票資訊：<br />\n📍 一般會員｜彩票數 2150 張 <br />\n📍 VIP 會員 ｜彩票數 1720 張<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854194253_1555400806608190_2019427815694731742_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=XMMpJd_H8kYQ7kNvwFIB1M9&amp;_nc_oc=AdrsRRYtm5ukYB-85A4bNYOKeGbslyPoqcRdIkHHeOH_XPmGh49UW2vlgSfL26-UG9o&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-vie1-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=zRhhbKvGBXQaVJ7nPzdTTw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLyBLwsGYDTH4qQ7wEVl9WLfNOH8uYS9D5hGR629UdmR6g4cLxY96H2N8HY6FRrd440Y4SkkHNS&amp;oh=00_AQOBXqwWk2g6cQ4VY7nMFmssWqFkrVIRqS-su1LXfQzdlw&amp;oe=6AE278E3\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/852275098_1555400836608187_8841894877258848294_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=DQNCF9-xARcQ7kNvwFpiQDS&amp;_nc_oc=Adr4lGb_ksoqP98JKuASiX2rPa9SMz_Zc_9nhW_bOa5IlcwoqWjfSLMYEGSMmcaUScI&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-vie1-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=zRhhbKvGBXQaVJ7nPzdTTw&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJx-d_zJ3_U_8WJeRFW3m5lNIuEtx6snN1HinNvjf92vGFeuP7278yBC1PzHq9jdrhGlvurA82N&amp;oh=00_AQN9nB36DEhDdU9KNZVomL-XmJlmtdn-aJdm4otecCARPA&amp;oe=6AE28278\" width=\"960\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-vie1-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854246055_1555400873274850_8856064918901545395_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=qx3CD554qZ4Q7kNvwH2gjar&amp;_nc_oc=Adq6KO8icWHCOsiofZK2u9HY2Cz_KFEzB7LELqJLvtOt4RuhmT40gz2h9N4E4rMflyc&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-